<title>UK: Bco Cidade sets $75 million eight-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Bco Cidade sets $75 million eight-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO CIDADE SA</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON     10.55     MATURITY    22.JAN.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    22.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.75	REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	+400 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	CALLABLE IN YEAR THREE AT 99.0 AND YEAR FIVE AT 99.5</p>
<p>		PUT IN YEAR THREE AT 98.5 AND YEAR FIVE AT 99.0</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
